  "question": {
    "text": "If a line passing through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is perpendicular to the vector <math><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and parallel to the plane containing vectors&nbsp;<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then <math><mn>10</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
  },
